     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Odds for:</p>\n<p>If the probability is <span data-math=\"\\frac{2}{{13}}\"></span> then the odds for the event are <span data-math=\"\\frac{2}{{13}}:\\left( {1 - \\frac{2}{{13}}} \\right)\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{2}{{13}}:\\frac{{11}}{{13}}\"></span></p>\n<p>Multiply both numbers by 13 to clear fractions.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\text{2:11}}\"></span></p>\n<p>Reverse the ratio to find the odds against the event.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\text{11: 2}}\"></span></p>\n"
    },
